.TH "glab" "1" "Sep 2026" "Auto generated by spf13/cobra" ""

.SH "نام (NAME)"
glab-ci-cancel \- Cancel a running pipeline or job.


.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBglab ci cancel  [flags]\fP


.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Cancel one or more running CI/CD pipelines or jobs.

.PP
Use the \fBpipeline\fR subcommand to cancel pipelines, or the \fBjob\fR
subcommand to cancel individual jobs.


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	Show help for this command.

.PP
\fB-R\fP, \fB--repo\fP=""
	Select another repository. You can use either OWNER/REPO or GROUP/NAMESPACE/REPO. The full URL or Git URL is also accepted.


.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBglab-ci(1)\fP, \fBglab-ci-cancel-job(1)\fP, \fBglab-ci-cancel-pipeline(1)\fP
